     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" data-account-id=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" accountid=\"5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Ben Pennell</a> Should the Batch Atomic sidecar spec be updated to mandate the inclusion of these headers?</p>",
